<p>ADDENDUM TO PRELIMINARY OFFICIAL STATEMENT</p>
<p>On page 7 of the Preliminary Official Statement, DELETE subparagraph (i) of the final paragraph and replace it with the following new subparagraph (i): (i) FIRST, until earlier of (a) the redemption of all Series 1997A-3 Bonds or (b) April 1, 2007, 86% of the moneys available for redemption (rounded up to the nearest $5,000) shall be applied to redeem Series 1997A-3 Bonds, and 14% of the moneys available for redemption (rounded down to the nearest $5,000) shall be applied to redeem Series 1997A Fixed Rate Bonds on a pro rata basis except that all portions so calculated excluding the portion so calculated for the Series 1997A-2 Serial Bonds shall be applied to redeem the Series 1997A-2 Bonds maturing March 1, 2017*; THE SENIOR MANAGER AND ISSUER RESERVE THE RIGHT TO REQUEST THE ZIP CODES &amp; CUSTOMER ACCOUNT NUMBERS ON ANY RETAIL ORDER.</p>
